      "safety_and_model_selection": [
        "Do not automatically download or run model weights; require an explicit user request and an approved destination.",
        "Check each exact model revision's license, usage restrictions, model card, provenance and security notes.",
        "Estimate RAM/VRAM, disk space, context length and inference speed before selecting a model; use quantization only when appropriate.",
        "Load untrusted model files and code in an isolated environment; do not execute remote custom model code by default.",
        "Never expose local model servers to the public internet without authentication, network restrictions and rate limits.",
        "Keep API keys and access tokens outside the repository and logs."
      ],
      "completion_project": "Build a local-or-API LLM chat prototype with a selectable model provider, a cited RAG knowledge base, and one permission-controlled tool-using agent. Add evaluation tests for retrieval, answer grounding, tool permissions and failure handling."
